                                "sense_id": "569ccd99-0936-3adf-9dd8-ff32c9e1aa01",
                                "text": "He employed his physician, Judah Morea, one of these converts, to draw up the famous astronomical tables, commonly called the Alphonsin; and likewise enjoined upon him the task of translating various Arabian treatises into Castilian."
